  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-html\" data-ke-type=\"html\" data-source=\"&lt;div class=&quot;txc-textbox&quot; style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&amp;gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size23&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\"><div data-ke-class=\"article\"><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size23\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">다각형의 모양을 이용하여 <span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>[물질의 상태변화] </b><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">명칭 및 예시를 확인하는 게임입니다. (^-^)</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99ACCC3C5DBFBF9820\" data-file-name=\"물질의 상태변화_게임.hwp\" data-file-size=\"5211648\" data-mimetype=\"\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D88%26fileid%3D24%26regdt%3D20191104150638&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcfile%2Fcafe%2F99ACCC3C5DBFBF9820')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">물질의 상태변화_게임</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">4.97MB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-html\" data-ke-type=\"html\" data-source=\"&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;\"><div data-ke-class=\"article\"><strong></strong></div></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9975D8415DBFBBEA1E\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9975D8415DBFBBEA1E\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"278\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">정삼각형(고액기) 12개</span></b>,</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #0900ff;\">사각형(상태변화 명칭)&#160;12개</span></b>,</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff007f;\">이등변삼각형(상태변화 예시)&#160;12개</span></b> 가 있구요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9954EC365DBFBB7813\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9954EC365DBFBB7813\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">완성작은 위와 같습니다. <b><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">링 2개를 </span></b>만들면 끝~!</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9975D8415DBFBB791D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9975D8415DBFBB791D\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">방법</span></b>은 이렇습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">①<u> <b><span style=\"color: #0900ff;\">&quot;액화&quot;</span></b>&#160;사각형</u>&#160;좌우에<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b> <u>&quot;고액기&#39; </u></b></span><u>삼각형을</u> 연결하여 붙입니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">그림처럼 6개의 명칭과 6개의 고액기를 연결하면 육각형 하나가 완성됩니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">파일에는 총 12개가 있으므로 이런 육각형 링을 2개 만들 수 있습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">②&#160;<b><u> 노란 이등변삼각형<span data-ke-size=\"size16\">&#160;&quot;예시&quot;</span></u></b> 를 상태변화 명칭 위에 올려 마무리 합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99918D415DBFBB7A1C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99918D415DBFBB7A1C\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">이렇게 말이죠.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">머리를 잘 굴리면, 깔끔하게 2개의 링을 만들 수 있는데,</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">마지막 안맞는 경우가 자주 발생하여</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>&quot;빨간색 매직 고액기&quot;</b></span>를 1개&#160;추가하여</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><u><b>아무 곳에나 넣을 수 있게 </b></u>변형하였습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">조별로 스피드전을 하여 과제면제권을 주기도하고</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">개인전으로 상품을 주기도 하였습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">피드백 주시면 큰 도움이 됩니다~~ *^-^* 감기 조심하세요~!!!</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">(아래는, 여러 과정샷과 활동 사진 입니다. ^-^)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99BFF6365DBFBB760E\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99BFF6365DBFBB760E\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/993746365DBFBB7614\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/993746365DBFBB7614\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9988EF365DBFBB7611\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9988EF365DBFBB7611\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9976BF415DBFBB781D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9976BF415DBFBB781D\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E2EA415DBFBB7818\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E2EA415DBFBB7818\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9975D8415DBFBB791D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9975D8415DBFBB791D\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/991BE0415DBFBB7915\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/991BE0415DBFBB7915\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p 